I'm trying to find the source code to the following game. I hope someone
can help.

A few years ago, I use to play a simple hack'n'slash dungeon game called
DND. This game let you choose your character out of 3 character classes: 
fighter, magic user, and cleric. Your character would then journey through
one of the 5 dungeons: The Warren, The Cavern, Telengard, Lamorte, and
Shvink's Lair. Your ultimate goal would be to recover the "orb" and get
back alive. It was simple game, but it was addictive and fun. I've played
this game on a DEC 20 (running TOPS-20), VAX (running BSD 4.2), and on
an MSDOS machine.

Is the source code to this game available? If so, how can I get it? I've
checked in comp.sources.games directories of various anonymous ftp sites but
I've had no such luck. I would love to obtain the most recent version of
the source code to this game if at all possible. Any help would be gratefully
apreciated. I'll post a summary of responses if I get any and if there is
enough interest. Thanks in advance.

